{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-browser#card-zh","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-browser","commit":"b5f9b2a8781ea3d48c6e0ebb8449ad842a0d92ee","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-browser 是面向 WSL 的 DSH 工具插件，可将网页交给 Windows 默认浏览器打开。它注册 win_open_url 工具，接收 URL，解析规范化后通过 Windows PowerShell 启动浏览器。插件支持 HTTP 和 HTTPS；遇到 localhost 或 127.0.0.1 地址时，还可在结果中提示使用 WSL IP 访问。适合在 WSL 运行 DSH、需要在 Windows 查看网页或本地服务的开发者。可配置调用超时，默认 15 秒；需要 WSL 和 Windows PowerShell，不需要 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:16-24","index.js:26-34","index.js:56-66","lib/browser.js:1-11","lib/browser.js:19-31","lib/wsl-host.js:34-42"]}
{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-browser#card-en","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-browser","commit":"b5f9b2a8781ea3d48c6e0ebb8449ad842a0d92ee","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-wsl-browser opens HTTP or HTTPS URLs in the Windows default browser from DSH on WSL. The win_open_url tool launches the supplied URL through PowerShell and can suggest a WSL IP for localhost links. It is for developers viewing WSL pages on Windows; WSL and PowerShell are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:16-24","index.js:26-34","index.js:56-66","lib/browser.js:1-11","lib/browser.js:19-31","lib/wsl-host.js:34-42"]}
